    "version_first_page_text": "                                                                                  HDC2021\nwww.ti.com                                                                SNAS773A – DECEMBER 2019 – REVISEDHDC2021JUNE 2020\n                                                                          SNAS773A – DECEMBER 2019 – REVISED JUNE 2020\n  HDC2021 High-Accuracy, Low-Power Humidity and Temperature Sensor With\n                     Assembly Protection Cover\n\n1 Features                              3 Description\n\n •  Factory-installed polyimide tape to protect sensor     The HDC2021 is an integrated relative humidity and\n    during assembly                                   temperature sensor with a factory-installed polyimide\n • RH measurement range: 0% to 100%                tape cover over the opening of the relative humidity\n •  Temperature measurement range: –40°C to 125°C    sensor element. The tape cover provides protection\n                                                         against pollutants that can appear in certain stages of •  Humidity accuracy: ±2% (typical), ±3% (maximum)\n                                                        the manufacturing process, such as SMT assembly,\n •  Temperature accuracy: ±0.2°C (typical), ±0.4°C\n                                      PCB board wash, and conformal coating. The tape\n   (maximum)\n                                                     design allows for a full conformal coating of the PCB,\n •  Supply voltage range: 1.62 V to 3.6 V                                               and includes an adhesive free corner tab for quick\n •  I2C interface compatibility                          removal using tweezers.\n •  50 nA sleep mode current\n                                             The HDC2021 device is backward-compatible with the\n •  550 nA average supply current (11-bit accuracy\n                                             HDC2080, providing high accuracy measurements\n    option, 1 measurement/second)\n                                                           with very low power consumption in a small DFN\n •  Continuous conversion or one-shot measurement                                                   package. The capacitive-based sensor includes new\n   mode                                                           integrated digital features and a heating element to\n •  Backward-compatible with HDC2080                   dissipate condensation and moisture. The HDC2021\n2 Applications                                               digital features include programmable interrupt\n                                                         thresholds to provide alerts and system wake-ups\n •  Thermostats                                          without requiring a microcontroller to continuously\n •  Smart speakers (with voice assistant)                monitor the system. Combined with programmable\n •  Washers and dryers                               sampling intervals, low power consumption, and 1.8-V\n •  HVAC sensor transmitters (temperature, pressure,     supply voltage support, the HDC2021 is designed for\n   and humidity)                                            ultra-low power battery-operated systems.\n •  HVAC system controllers                                       Device Information\n •  Wireless environmental sensors                                                                                                                                   (1)\n                                                   PART NUMBER     PACKAGE     BODY SIZE (NOM)\n                                                                                       VDD\n    HDC2021                                                     VDD                VDD          HDC2021       WSON (6)           3.00 mm × 3.00 mm\n\n\n                                                                          SCL\n          RH                                      